&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll drive product adoption by building robust go-to-market and Business Development enablement programs, defining activation goals, and partnering closely with Business Development, Developer Operations, Product, and Developer Relations to successfully bring new platform capabilities to market. This role will play a key part in accelerating adoption of Discord&#39;s Unified Developer Platform across the Gaming industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a self-starter and team player who excels in fast-paced environments and zero to scale projects, this is a unique opportunity to make a significant impact on Discord&#39;s developer ecosystem and shape the future of our platform business. We&#39;re looking for an experienced, strategic PMM who is passionate about developers, gaming, and building products that enable partners to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
